Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 12:09:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 039/140] feat(tv): add partial Android TV support

Add TV launcher metadata and D-pad focus behavior across onboarding, browsing, settings, and player controls. Refine seekbar progress and read-ahead contrast.
